--- Overview
This PR replaces the orchestrator's own git version detection with the buildtools.Git.Version support now available upstream, and bumps the cloudeng.io dependencies to pick it up.

--- Key Changes
orchestrator/version.go
  * Removed the local versionInfo type and the gitStatus helper.
  * gitVersion now hands off to buildtools.NewGit(dir).Version(...) and returns buildtools.Version. It still uses DefaultVersion when no short version is given.

orchestrator/bundle_cmd.go
  * buildInfoPlist now takes a buildtools.Version instead of versionInfo.

orchestrator/bundle_cmd_test.go
  * Tests now build buildtools.Version values instead of versionInfo.

orchestrator/go.mod
  * Bumped these direct dependencies: cloudeng.io/{algo,file,logging,macos,os,vms}.
  * Bumped these indirect dependencies: cloudeng.io/{encoding,security,sys,types}.

--- Breaking Changes
None. The changes are internal to the main package.

